<section class="hq-trap-section">
<div class="lf-h1">T 陷阱診斷專區 — 高品質陷阱題</div>
<p>霖楓教研團隊精心設計，每題針對一個常見考試陷阱。5題。</p>
<div class="lf-trap-section">
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P3-0101">
<div class="lf-trap-header">
<span class="lf-trap-badge">T3 逆向</span>
<span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T3-P3-0101</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-trap-q">小明有啲糖，食咗8粒後剩返12粒。原本有幾多？</div>
<div class="lf-trap-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--red);">想想看！為什麼這是陷阱？寫出正確答案：</p></div>
<div class="trap-correct"><span class="lf-ex-label">正確答案：</span>20粒</div>
<div class="trap-mantra"><span class="lf-ex-label">口訣：</span>「剩返加食咗，就係原本」</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P3-0102">
<div class="lf-trap-header">
<span class="lf-trap-badge">T3 送咗</span>
<span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T3-P3-0102</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-trap-q">媽媽買咗啲蘋果，送咗5個俾婆婆，仲有7個。媽媽買咗幾多個？</div>
<div class="lf-trap-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--red);">想想看！為什麼這是陷阱？寫出正確答案：</p></div>
<div class="trap-correct"><span class="lf-ex-label">正確答案：</span>12個</div>
<div class="trap-mantra"><span class="lf-ex-label">口訣：</span>「送走咗要加返嚟搵原本」</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P3-0103">
<div class="lf-trap-header">
<span class="lf-trap-badge">T3 落車</span>
<span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T3-P3-0103</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-trap-q">車上原本有啲人，15人落車後，仲有23人。原本有幾多人？</div>
<div class="lf-trap-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--red);">想想看！為什麼這是陷阱？寫出正確答案：</p></div>
<div class="trap-correct"><span class="lf-ex-label">正確答案：</span>38人</div>
<div class="trap-mantra"><span class="lf-ex-label">口訣：</span>「落咗車嘅人加返車上嘅人=原本」</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P3-0104">
<div class="lf-trap-header">
